@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 10
title Restaurant Rush Stage 3\nCustomer 3 combo during Happy Hour in the victory replay
actor Manager as M
boundary RestaurantCLI as CLI
control RestaurantController as RC
participant "host: Host" as H
participant "customer3: Customer" as C
participant "happyHour: HappyHourPolicy" as HH
participant "waiter: Waiter" as W
participant "chef: Chef" as CH
participant "order3: Order" as O
participant "table1: Table" as T
participant "cashier: Cashier" as CA
note over CLI,CA
Precondition: victory-input.txt, turns 1-6 completed; Table 1 is free.
Customer 3 is Regular. Other customers' concurrent actions are omitted.
Repeated getters, validation internals and redundant setActed calls are abbreviated.
end note
== Arrival and manager choice: turn 7 ==
CLI -> RC: executeTurn() [end of turn 6]
RC -> RC: currentTurn++; checkAndProcessArrival()
create C
RC -> C: new Customer(3, 7)
RC -> C: setStatus(QUEUED)
RC -> RC: waitingQueue.add(customer3)
M -> CLI: Activate Happy Hour at start of turn 7
CLI -> RC: startTurn(true)
RC -> HH: activate()
HH --> RC: true; remainingTurns = 2
loop [each queued / occupied-table customer while active]
RC -> C: recoverSatisfaction(15)
note right of C: QUEUED or SEATED only; maximum 100.
end
CLI -> RC: getHappyHourRemainingTurns()
RC -> HH: getRemainingTurns()
HH --> RC: 2
RC --> CLI: 2
M -> CLI: Host seats at Table 1
CLI -> RC: executeHostTask(1)
RC -> H: seatCustomer(customer3, table1)
H -> T: seatCustomer(customer3)
T -> C: setStatus(SEATED)
H -> H: setActed(true)
H --> RC: true
RC -> RC: waitingQueue.remove(0)
M -> CLI: Waiter takes order at Table 1
loop [retry until a valid Waiter choice]
CLI -> RC: executeWaiterTask(2, 1)
alt [invalid table / status / already ordered / staff used]
RC --> CLI: false; explain reason; task not consumed
else [valid: seated, no order, Waiter unused, Chef not acted]
RC -> C: orderFood(menu)
C --> RC: Burger + Pasta Combo (2970 cents, 3 units)
RC -> HH: priceFor(customer3, item)
HH -> C: getDiscountedPrice(2970)
C --> HH: 2970 (Regular)
HH --> RC: round(2970 * 0.8) = 2376
RC -> W: takeOrder(table1, item, 3, 2376)
create O
W -> O: new Order(3, item, 2376)
note right of O: ORDERED, 3 units; final billCents = 2376.
W -> T: assignOrder(order3)
W -> W: setActed(true)
W --> RC: order3
RC --> CLI: true
CLI -> M: Show chosen combo, preparation units and locked bill
end
end
note over H,W
Manager's choice changes the flow: Host seating leaves the Waiter free to order on turn 7.
Using the Waiter to seat instead consumes its task and delays ordering until turn 8 or later.
Without activation on turn 7, this new order locks at $29.70, instead of $23.76.
end note
== Cooking across turns 7-9 ==
loop [turns 7, 8, 9; one Chef unit each turn]
opt [turn 8 or 9]
CLI -> RC: startTurn(false)
opt [turn 8: Happy Hour still active]
RC -> C: recoverSatisfaction(15)
note right of C: Turn 8: 92 -> 100; no recovery on turn 9.
end
CLI -> RC: executeHostTask(0)
CLI -> RC: executeWaiterTask(0, 0)
end
M -> CLI: Assign Chef to order 3
CLI -> RC: executeChefTask(3)
RC -> CH: cookOrder(order3)
CH -> O: advancePrep()
alt [remainingUnits > 0]
O -> O: status = PREPARING
else [remainingUnits = 0 on turn 9]
O -> O: status = READY
end
CH -> CH: setActed(true)
CLI -> RC: executeTurn()
RC -> C: getSatisfactionLoss()
C --> RC: 8
RC -> C: reduceSatisfaction(8)
RC -> HH: endTurn()
note over HH,O: Happy Hour remaining after turn 7 = 1; after turn 8 = 0. Locked bill stays 2376.
RC -> H: resetTurn()
RC -> W: resetTurn()
RC -> CH: resetTurn()
RC -> CA: resetTurn()
RC -> RC: currentTurn++; checkAndProcessArrival()
end
note over W,O
Chef completes order 3 on turn 9, after the Waiter's task.
The Waiter can first serve it on turn 10. Satisfaction after turn 9 = 84.
end note
== Serving: turn 10 ==
CLI -> RC: startTurn(false)
CLI -> RC: executeHostTask(2) [seats customer 4; detail omitted]
M -> CLI: Prioritize READY order 3 over taking customer 4's order
CLI -> RC: executeWaiterTask(3, 1)
RC -> O: getStatus()
O --> RC: READY
RC -> W: serveOrder(table1)
W -> T: getCurrentOrder(); getCurrentCustomer()
W -> O: setStatus(SERVED)
W -> C: setStatus(SERVED)
W -> W: setActed(true)
RC -> RC: servedCount++
CLI -> RC: executeChefTask(0)
CLI -> RC: executeTurn()
note over RC,CA: Payment scan precedes eating progression; this customer is not READY_TO_PAY.
RC -> C: setStatus(EATING) [was SERVED]
note over C,O: No satisfaction decay after serving. Customer 3 remains at 84.
RC -> HH: endTurn()
RC -> RC: reset staff; advance to turn 11; process arrivals
== Eating: turn 11 ==
note over CLI,RC: startTurn(false), Host Wait; Waiter and Chef work on customer 4 (omitted).
CLI -> RC: executeTurn()
RC -> C: setStatus(READY_TO_PAY) [was EATING]
note over RC,CA: Became ready this turn; payment cannot occur until next turn.
RC -> HH: endTurn()
RC -> RC: reset staff; advance to turn 12; process arrivals
== Payment: turn 12 ==
note over CLI,RC: startTurn(false), Host Wait, Waiter Wait, Chef cooks order 4 (omitted).
CLI -> RC: executeTurn()
RC -> RC: scan tables for oldest READY_TO_PAY by arrivalTurn
opt [oldestReadyTable = table1]
RC -> CA: processPayment(table1)
CA -> T: getCurrentCustomer(); getCurrentOrder()
CA -> O: getPrice()
O --> CA: 2376 (bill locked on turn 7)
CA -> C: setStatus(PAID)
CA -> O: setStatus(PAID)
CA -> T: clearTable()
CA -> CA: setActed(true)
CA --> RC: 2376
RC -> RC: revenueCents += 2376; paidCustomersCount++
RC -> C: getSatisfaction()
C --> RC: 84
RC -> RC: totalPaidSatisfaction += 84
note over RC,T: Controller also repeats PAID assignments and clearTable(); duplicates omitted.
end
RC -> HH: endTurn()
RC -> RC: reset staff; advance to turn 13; process arrivals
== Continue and check final result ==
loop [remaining turns 13-18; same CLI / controller turn flow]
CLI -> RC: startTurn(false); staff assignments; executeTurn()
note over CLI,RC: Same victory replay continues; no early ending.
end
CLI -> RC: isGameOver()
RC --> CLI: true [currentTurn = 19]
CLI -> RC: checkGameResult()
alt [paid >= 4 AND revenueCents >= 4500 AND average >= 60]
RC --> CLI: VICTORY (5 paid, 7926 cents, average 83.8)
else [any target unmet]
RC --> CLI: DEFEAT
end
CLI -> CLI: displayGameOver(result, controller)
CLI -> M: Show final result and totals
@enduml
